    "_type": "localeRichText",
    "en": [
      {
        "_key": "aum",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "aul",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A variety of vine"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "auo",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "aun",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A grape variety is a variety of vine. Like apples, all bunches look alike from afar, but each variety has its own colour, acidity and aromas. A Golden is not a Granny Smith; a pinot noir is not a chardonnay."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "auq",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "aup",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Three main grapes"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "aus",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "aur",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Three grapes cover almost the entire Champagne vineyard. Pinot noir comes first, followed by meunier and chardonnay, almost level. Pinot noir brings structure, meunier roundness and fruit, chardonnay finesse and freshness."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "auu",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "aut",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Five rarer grapes"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "avb",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "auv",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The appellation rules also allow four old varieties: "
          },
          {
            "_key": "aux",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "auw"
            ],
            "text": "pinot blanc"
          },
          {
            "_key": "auy",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "_key": "av0",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "auz"
            ],
            "text": "pinot gris"
          },
          {
            "_key": "av1",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "_key": "av3",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "av2"
            ],
            "text": "arbane"
          },
          {
            "_key": "av4",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "_key": "av6",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "av5"
            ],
            "text": "petit meslier"
          },
          {
            "_key": "av7",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Since 2025, an eighth has joined them: "
          },
          {
            "_key": "av9",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "av8"
            ],
            "text": "chardonnay rose"
          },
          {
            "_key": "ava",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Together they occupy only a tiny place in the vineyard."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
