    "fr": [
      {
        "_key": "atb",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "ata",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Une variété de vigne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "atd",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "atc",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Un cépage, c'est une variété de vigne. Comme les pommes, toutes les grappes se ressemblent de loin, mais chaque variété a sa couleur, son acidité, ses arômes. Une golden n'est pas une granny ; un pinot noir n'est pas un chardonnay."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "atf",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "ate",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Trois grands cépages"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "ath",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "atg",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Trois cépages couvrent la quasi-totalité du vignoble champenois. Le pinot noir arrive en tête, suivi du meunier et du chardonnay, presque à égalité. Le pinot noir apporte la structure, le meunier la rondeur et le fruit, le chardonnay la finesse et la fraîcheur."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "atj",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "ati",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Cinq cépages plus rares"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "au0",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "atk",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Le cahier des charges de l'appellation autorise aussi quatre cépages anciens : le "
          },
          {
            "_key": "atm",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "atl"
            ],
            "text": "pinot blanc"
          },
          {
            "_key": "atn",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", le "
          },
          {
            "_key": "atp",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "ato"
            ],
            "text": "pinot gris"
          },
          {
            "_key": "atq",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", l'"
          },
          {
            "_key": "ats",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "atr"
            ],
            "text": "arbane"
          },
          {
            "_key": "att",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " et le "
          },
          {
            "_key": "atv",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "atu"
            ],
            "text": "petit meslier"
          },
          {
            "_key": "atw",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Depuis 2025, un huitième les a rejoints : le "
          },
          {
            "_key": "aty",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "atx"
            ],
            "text": "chardonnay rose"
          },
          {
            "_key": "atz",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Ensemble, ils n'occupent qu'une toute petite place dans le vignoble."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "atl",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/cepages-champagne/pinot-blanc"
          },
