        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "aw3",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "aw2",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Drie rassen beslaan bijna de hele Champagne-wijngaard. Pinot noir staat bovenaan, gevolgd door meunier en chardonnay, bijna gelijk. Pinot noir brengt structuur, meunier rondheid en fruit, chardonnay finesse en frisheid."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "aw5",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "aw4",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Vijf zeldzamere rassen"
